//! Adversary pass 1 over the `federation-verifier` unit of
//! `story:signing-and-verification`.
//!
//! Every case here drives `verifier_real.rs` against a document the unit itself cites —
//! `tests/security/cases.json`, `docs/architecture/federated-login.md`,
//! `docs/sources/original-design.md` §29.2 and §29.3 — or against a property the module's
//! own documentation claims. Nothing in this file changes an implementation.
//!
//! No key is committed: every key is generated by `aws_lc_rs` when the case runs. No case
//! reaches the network: the HTTP cases bind their own `TcpListener` on the loopback
//! interface and answer themselves.

